    "body": "Merged `upstream/main` (86b3393a). The Fanuc probe goldens are regenerated on top of #174's protected moves, and `probe_guard` now expects the one extra protected descent per mode. This matches the resolution in #581's stack merge byte for byte.\n\nRe-gated with `scripts/gate.sh quick`, which escalated to batch:\n- geometry, cl, tools, post, sim, motion and app all pass;\n- probe_search 3, probe_guard 5, probe_op 11, probe_reach 5, probe_pick 9, fanuc_post 11, posting 17, conformance 6;\n- clippy is clean on all crates.\n\nThe only reds are the 3 headless-GPU ui tests, which are environmental on this host. Flagging ready again.",
